<title>AUSTRIA: Bank Austria has stake in Wienerberger/Koramic unit. [CORRECTED 12:00 GMT]</title>
<headline>Bank Austria has stake in Wienerberger/Koramic unit. [CORRECTED 12:00 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA 1997-03-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>(Correct headline to clarify that Bank Austria has not bought into Wienerberger/Koramic but acquired its interest following takeover of Creditanstalt)</p>
<p>Bank Austria holds between five and 10 percent of building materials group Wienerberger Baustoffindustrie AG following the bank's takeover of Creditanstalt, Wienerberger said on Friday.</p>
<p>In a statement, published in Vienna newspaper Wiener Zeitung, Wienerberger said Wienerberger Holding GmbH, a 50:50 joint venture between Creditanstalt and Belgium's Koramic, had an unchanged Wienerberger stake of 50 percent plus two shares.</p>
<p>-- Vienna newsroom, +43-1 531 12 254</p>
